# Defensive allowlist: ignore everything in .claude/ by default,
# then explicitly un-ignore the files/dirs we want to track.
# This prevents secrets, caches, sessions, and OAuth tokens from
# ever being accidentally committed if dropped in this folder.
*
!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!settings.json
!keybindings.json
!statusline.sh
!commands/
!commands/**
!skills/
!skills/**
